.
.  Create a GIF file for a run sequence plot
.
DEVICE 1 OFF
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
SKIP 25
READ HAMAKER.DAT Y X1 X2 X3 TAG
.
LABEL SIZE 3
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
CHAR SIZE 3 ALL
Y1LABEL THRUST FORCE
X1LABEL DRILL SPEED (X1)
YLIMITS 0 1500
XTIC OFFSET 25 0
.
CHARACTERS 1 2 1 2 1 2
LINES SOLID SOLID DOT DOT DASH2 DASH2
PRE-ERASE OFF
PLOT Y X1 TAG
.
QUIT
